  "stageId": "main_03-02",
  "title": "記憶",
  "storyCode": "3-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4fa42a7eac354a264413def968f7095d47e3356c016c938a06a0d4d8900843c4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你終於到了，星熊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "抱歉，被那個人拖了好久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "有沒有受傷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "但我確實被那個感染者的實力嚇了一跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "特別督察組加強了對龍門本區的防守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我帶出來的這些，就是全部可用的小隊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......特別督察組，真的是被她一個人阻擋住了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "沒親眼見過之前，我也不敢相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "那個傢伙，確實有這個水準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "而且，她甚至有些......心不在焉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "話說回來，你身邊這些人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "是不是就是羅德島啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官，這位是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "特別督察組的精英，星熊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你們就是羅德島？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "咦，這麼小的孩子，也是羅德島的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "她可是領導人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳，陳長官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "哇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不問別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "現在，你們有什麼想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "兩位我方的特別行動人員，已經探明了劫持者的去向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "她們正在跟蹤這支整合運動，我們可以隨她們的指引行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "可以啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "老陳，你上次確實誇在點子上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "這些人很在行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官......誇讚我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "星熊，召集近衛局所有小隊，該行動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "羅德島，你們帶路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——瞭解。當然，整合運動似乎留下了一些斷後的戰鬥人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "他們正埋伏在路線上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "這簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯，我們只要小心謹慎地行動，就能發現他們的蹤跡，先發制人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "就讓我看看，羅德島戰鬥起來是不是也一樣內行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
